This rule describes the control loop of getting something done.

This rule urgently requests an agent to do all of the following:
- Address the changes requested
- Add all changes with the git CLI. Don't confirm with git status.
- Create a diff summary [diff-summary.mdc](mdc:.cursor/rules/diff-summary.mdc) and write it to /tmp/commit.txt
- Use `git commit -F /tmp/commit.txt` to commit the changes
- Use `git push origin` to push to the remote